    thinking: "**Exploring Search Integration**\n\nI\'m excited to share that Gemini 3.8 Flash now natively integrates with Google Search through `{ googleSearch: {} }`! This means I can pull in real-time web search results and their metadata, including titles, URIs, and search queries, directly for grounding and analysis. This is a game-changer for staying up-to-date and providing relevant information.\n\n\n"
