  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Typography Styles**\n\nI\'m currently working on defining typography styles for Tailwind v4. I\'ve started by creating utility classes in `src/index.css`.  I\'m adding classes like `font-serif` for Newsreader, `font-sans` for Inter, and `font-mono` for JetBrains Mono to improve how the font looks in the text.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_54517"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"export type AcademicLevel = \'beginner\' | \'undergraduate\' | \'advanced\';\\nexport type BriefLength = \'short\' | \'medium\' | \'long\';\\nexport type SourceTypeFilter = \'all\' | \'gov\' | \'edu\' | \'news\' | \'reports\' | \'papers\';\\n\\nexport type VerificationStatus = \'supported\' | \'partially_supported\' | \'contradicted\' | \'unverified\';\\n\\nexport interface SourceItem {\\n  id: string; // e.g. \\\"S1\\\", \\\"S2\\\"\\n  title: string;\\n  url: string;\\n  publisher: string;\\n  domain: string;\\n  publishedDate: string; // or \\\"Unavailable / Undated\\\"\\n  sourceType: \'Government\' | \'Educational\' | \'News\' | \'Official Report\' | \'Research Paper\' | \'Organizational\';\\n  credibilityScore: number; // 0-100\\n  credibilityTier: \'High Authority\' | \'Moderate Authority\' | \'Standard Reference\';\\n  credibilityNotes: string;\\n  excerpt: string;\\n  accessible: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ClaimVerification {\\n  id: string; // e.g. \\\"CLM-001\\\"\\n  claimText: string;\\n  sourceIds: string[]; // e.g. [\\\"S1\\\", \\\"S3\\\"]\\n  evidenceExcerpt: string;\\n  status: VerificationStatus;\\n  confidenceScore: number; // 0 - 100\\n  rationale: string;\\n  sectionRef: \'Executive Summary\' | \'Introduction\' | \'Key Findings\' | \'Evidence Analysis\' | \'Limitations & Conflicts\' | \'Conclusion\';\\n  contradictionFlag?: boolean;\\n  revisedText?: string;\\n  originalClaimBeforeRevision?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface BriefSection {\\n  heading: string;\\n  content: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AcademicReference {\\n  id: string; // e.g. \\\"S1\\\"\\n  citationNumber: number;\\n  authorsOrPublisher: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  publicationDate: string;\\n  url: string;\\n  sourceType: string;\\n  formattedCitation: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface StageAudit {\\n  stageNumber: number;\\n  name: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  status: \'pending\' | \'in_progress