  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Frontend Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m now delving into the client-side frontend component design. I\'m taking a close look at the UI features, focusing specifically on color palette and typography. The goal is to adhere to the requested \"navy, white, and restrained violet\" color scheme, keeping the aesthetic as specified in the original request. I\'ve noted the deep navy hex codes for the header/accent elements.\n\n\n**Analyzing UI Typography**\n\nI\'ve been refining the typographic approach for the UI. I\'ve chosen Newsreader for titles, citations, and excerpts, with Inter for general UI elements. JetBrains Mono will be used for labels and system codes, ensuring clean presentation. I\'m focusing on unboxed metadata with subtle separators and clear controls, avoiding overly flashy elements.\n\n\n**Designing Brief Generation Flow**\n\nI\'m now designing the user interface for brief generation. I\'ve specified fields for research topic, question, academic level, and brief length. I\'ve also added source type preferences and a \"Generate Brief\" button. I\'m especially focused on a live 8-stage progress dashboard, with a visual tracker and messages during brief generation. Finally, I\'m thinking about a results dashboard with key metrics such as a Rigor Index and source/claim tallies.\n\n\n**Structuring Information Presentation**\n\nI\'m now focused on the UI\'s information architecture. I\'ve designed a tabbed navigation system for the main views: Academic Brief, Claim Verification Ledger, Source Discovery & Credibility, 8-Stage Pipeline Audit, and Traceable References. The interactive citations are coming together nicely; hovering over citations like [S1] and [S2] will provide source details and evidence excerpts in a drawer or popover. The evidence table with claim-level verification is structured and I\'m developing its core columns.\n\n\n**Refining Ledger Interface**\n\nI\'m now implementing the Claim Verification Ledger\'s UI. I\'ve focused on displaying claim statements with revisions, along with supporting sources and evidence excerpts, styled with quotes. I\'m incorporating verification status indicators and epistemic rationales. I\'m adding clickable sources and an \"Open Original Source\" action. Also, I am adding a verification status filter. The action toolbar for clean brief copies, exports, new research, and audit inspection is almost complete.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_134104"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { BookOpen, ShieldCheck, Activity, Sparkles, RefreshCw } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface HeaderProps {\\n  onSelectSample: (key: string) => void;\\n  onReset: () => void;\\n  currentTopic?: string;\\n  hasGeminiKey?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Header: React.FC<HeaderProps> = ({\\n  onSelectSample,\\n  onReset,\\n  currentTopic,\\n  hasGeminiKey = true,\\n}) => {\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"border-b border-slate-200 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm sticky top-0 z-40 transition-all\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between h-16 sm:h-20\\\">\\n          {/* Logo & Title */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onReset}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 text-left group focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-600 rounded-lg p-1\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-md shadow-slate-900/10 group-hover:bg-indigo-950 transition-colors\\\">\\n              <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-6 h-6 text-indigo-400 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-serif font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight\\\">\\n                  Verified Academic Brief Generator\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-indigo-700 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded\\\">\\n                  v2.4 Grounded\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-sans hidden sm:block\\\">\\n                Epistemic AI Research & Traceable Claim-Level Evidence Verification\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Quick Actions & Sample Topics */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-200 pr-3 mr-1\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-medium text-slate-500\\\">Sample Topics:</span>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => onSelectSample(\'mrna-vaccine-distribution\')}\\n                className=\\\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 font-medium transition-colors\\\"\\n              >\\n                mRNA Equity\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => onSelectSample(\'post-quantum-cryptography\')}\\n                className=\\\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 font-medium transition-colors\\\"\\n              >\\n                Post-Quantum NIST\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={onReset}\\n              className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 rounded-lg transition-colors\\\"\\n              title=\\\"Reset search and create new brief\\\"\\n            >\\n              <RefreshCw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500\\\" />\\n              <span>New Research</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create professional academic header component with branding and sample triggers\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Header.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating Header component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Header component\"}"
