  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining App State**\n\nI\'m now focusing on constructing `src/App.tsx`. I\'ve begun reviewing the primary views and states this component requires. I\'ve pinpointed the active tabs, which will cycle between \'brief\', \'claims\', \'sources\', \'stages\', and \'references\'. I\'m also planning the state, including `brief` data, represented as `AcademicBriefData | null`, and an `isLoading` flag.\n\n\n**Refining Application State**\n\nI\'ve been refining the application state definition. I\'ve added `currentStage` (a number from 1 to 8), `stageMessage`, `error`, `selectedSourceModal`, `activeStatusFilter`, and `hasGeminiKey` to the state. I\'m also planning the UI features, including a header with buttons, research form, stage tracker, metrics bar, tab navigation, an error alert, an epistemic disclaimer banner, and a source detail modal. I\'m also considering API calls, specifically event streams to `/api/stream` in `handleGenerate`.\n\n\n"
